  "instruction": "Open Visual Studio Code and create a Python script named `titanic_openml_summary.py` under `/home/user/analysis_results/`. In the script, use the `openml` library to fetch the Titanic dataset (ID 40945) from OpenML. Load it into a pandas DataFrame, print its column names, and compute the average passenger age (ignoring missing values). Save this value (rounded to two decimals) into a text file named `titanic_summary.txt` in the same folder.",

